WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:03,290
Push it upstairs quickly

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,490
You guys should hide too

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:07,650
Hide upstairs on the opposite side and get out quickly.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,010
We have no obligation to protect you

5
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,180
Go find something quickly

6
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,980
Why am I standing there stupidly?

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,380
I have no strength in my legs

8
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:25,900
I can't hide from my path. Something is coming. Shutter. God, please save me.

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,940
Give me a way to survive

10
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,780
Go away instead of asking God

11
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,980
You might as well beg me

12
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,820
Please be quiet and stop making noise.

13
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,540
I'm going to bring Sansiki over too.

14
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:43,140
Shut up. Sansi is here. Shut up.

15
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:45,950
Block the door quickly

16
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,910
It’s not enough to get more things

17
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,940
stop making noise

18
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:51,940
please

19
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,020
Sansji is coming
